  "sn22.17:1.1": "sāvatthiyaṃ. tatra kho. ",
  "sn22.17:1.2": "rūpaṃ bhikkhave anattā ",
  "sn22.17:1.3": "taṃ netaṃ mama nesohamasmi na meso attāti evametaṃ yathābhūtaṃ sammappaññāya daṭṭhabbaṃ ",
  "sn22.17:1.4": "…pe… ",
  "sn22.17:1.5": "",
  "sn22.17:1.6": "",
  "sn22.17:1.7": "",
  "sn22.17:1.8": "",
  "sn22.17:1.9": "evaṃ passaṃ bhikkhave …pe… ",
  "sn22.17:1.10": "nāparaṃ itthattāyāti pajānātīti. ",
